		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Giant moray eel with a deep- sea angler head. Four dull, yellow eyes deep in the skull.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 39, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +5 (1d12) or lightning bolt, <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Absorb Lightning</strong>. Immune to lightning. If damaged by electricity, regains lightning bolt ability.</p><p></p><p><strong>Lightning Bolt</strong>. 1/day, bolt of lightning in a straight line (5' wide) extending double near from skrimsl. DEX 15+ or 3d6 damage (DISADV on check if wearing metal armor).</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
